 34S 3c  {+34}S. Measured |s(E(e'),|q). Deduced form factors, transition charge 
 34S 4c  densities, transition radii, and transition strengths from the measured
 34S 5c  cross sections.                                                        
 34S  c  1994Pe08: {+34}S(e,e') with 28-64-MeV electron beams from MUSL-2       
 34S 2c  (microtron using a superconducting linac 2) at the Nuclear Physics     
 34S 3c  Laboratory of the University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign. The      
 34S 4c  target was CaS powder with 95%-enriched {+34}S. Scattered electrons    
 34S 5c  were momentum-analyzed and detected in a focal plane vertical-drift    
 34S 6c  wire chamber. Measured |s(E(e'),|q). Deduced transition radii and      
 34S 7c  transition strengths from the measured cross sections.                 
